      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "村口，一位老武師攔住了你：「要上塔？先挑一把趁手的兵器。先拿林邊那隻苔蛙練練手，我教你怎麼打，不合手就換。」",
        "en": "At the edge of the village an old weapon master stops you: \"Climbing the tower? Pick a weapon that fits your hand first. Practise on the toad at the edge of the woods, and I will show you how to fight. Change if one does not suit you.\""
      },
      "choices": [
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "聽聽各種兵器。",
            "en": "Tell me about them."
          },
          "next": "weapons"
        },
        {
          "label": {
            "zh_TW": "試試弓",
