    "weapons": {
      "text": {
        "zh_TW": "「弓：往後拉再放開，拉得越久越有力。劍：照著指示的方向揮砍。法杖：依序點中出現的圓圈。」",
        "en": "\"The bow: draw back and let go, and the longer the draw, the harder the shot. The sword: slash the way it shows you. The staff: touch the circles in their order.\""
